Description: Limit the frame rate to keep the original speed
 The "3d" (jylam) and "different wavelengths in the visible spectrum"
 (dwitvs) entries advance their animation by a fixed step at each frame,
 without any timer: "3d" shows each scene for 500 frames, dwitvs lasts
 3600 frames. On current hardware they run several times too fast.
 Cap the frame rate to DEMO_FPS (60 by default) with
 SDL_GetTicks()/SDL_Delay() after each SDL_Flip(). The other two entries
 already use a timer and are not changed.
